# <%= current_page.data.title %>

## Analytical Platform support rota

[Rota through SSO](https://moj-digital-tools.pagerduty.com/schedules#POE95CC)

To add someone to the rota raise a PR to add them to the list of PagerDuty users in `users.tf` first and then raise a separate PR to update the `schedules.tf`. (Terraform may try to update the schedule first, so the new user must exist already).

### Responsibilities

- Approving and merging dependabot pull requests across Analytical Platform repositories.
- Approving airflow pull requests submitted in the #ask-analytical-platform channel.
- Addressing support requests that come in via support page. These will also be raised in the #analytical-platform-notifications channel.
- Monitoring emails in the team shared mailbox analytical-platform.

### Rules of thumb 👍

- Approving PRs for Airflow: as long as the validation scripts pass it's generally OK to approve, branch does not need to be up to date.
- PRs granting access may require approval from a relevant team/G7, for example, Data Engineering; approval may be added in the PR comments.
